<title>UK: GSI sets call warrants on Baloise.</title>
<headline>GSI sets call warrants on Baloise.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International has issued five million American-style call warrants on registered shares of Baloise Holding, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Bank said.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 100 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    2,900 CHF		 PREMIUM	12.19 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.75 CHF		  GEARING	10.29 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 18.FEB.97-17.JUL.98   PAYDATE	17.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 500</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  2,830 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
